---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — NEXA" description="How to contact NEXA. This static page does not collect or send form data — use the channels listed here.">
  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width:800px;padding:2.5rem 1rem 0">
    <h1 class="font-display" style="font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:900">Contact</h1>
    <div class="glass" style="padding:26px;margin-top:1.2rem">
      <p class="text-dim" style="line-height:1.8">NEXA is run by a small creator team. The fastest way to reach us is through the public channels where NEXA already publishes — the link hub collects them in one place:</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1rem"><a class="btn magnetic" href="https://nexa-1st.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the NEXA Link hub ↗</a></p>
      <p class="text-faint" style="font-size:.88rem;margin-top:1rem">That link opens the existing NEXA Link page (a separate project) in a new tab.</p>
      <h2 style="font-weight:800;margin-top:1.8rem">About this form</h2>
      <p class="text-dim" style="margin-top:.5rem;line-height:1.8">This static website has no contact-form backend, and we will not pretend otherwise. A form that silently discards messages helps nobody — so there is no fake form here. When a free form provider is connected by the site owner, this page will be updated with a working one and a note saying so.</p>
      <h2 style="font-weight:800;margin-top:1.8rem">Business &amp; corrections</h2>
      <p class="text-dim" style="margin-top:.5rem;line-height:1.8">For sponsorships, tool submissions for the directory, or corrections to an article, reach out via the link hub channels and mention the article URL. Corrections are a priority — if we published something wrong, we want to fix it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
